80:[[],["$","$L52",null,{"className":"case-jobs__arrival","children":["$","$L96",null,{"headingLevel":3,"intro":["The shop has three jobs. The main page opens on two of them, Buy Stuff and Sell Stuff; paying runs through the wallet."],"jobs":[{"line":"Explore categories on the main page","media":{"id":"nerd-town-job-main-page-first-screen","type":"image","src":"/nerd-town/wall/main-page-first-screen.webp","alt":"The first screen of the Nerd Town main page: the logo and the cart, wallet and profile icons in the header, the green Buy Stuff and Sell Stuff doors either side of an isometric city, Explore categories with a card for each category, its photo, its name and its count of items, then the catalog’s first row with Category, Search and the Search button.","caption":"Main page: the two doors, Explore categories and the top of the catalog.","provenance":"production","width":1080,"height":768,"aspectRatio":"1080 / 768"},"text":"Below the main page’s two doors, Explore categories shows how many items each category holds. Under the item, a listing shows Similar items and Recently viewed. In the cart, a stepper changes the quantity and a delete button takes the item out.","title":"Buy a collectible"},{"line":"List item on your own page","media":{"id":"nerd-town-job-user-profile-first-screen","type":"image","src":"/nerd-town/wall/user-profile-first-screen.webp","alt":"The first screen of your own page in Nerd Town: your avatar in the header, your card with a photo, the user name, the items listed and sold and the date you joined, List item and Edit profile, About seller and Seller policies, then Category, Search and the filters, Status first.","caption":"Your own page: your card with List item and Edit profile, Seller policies and the filters over your items.","provenance":"production","width":1080,"height":768,"aspectRatio":"1080 / 768"},"text":"Your own page has List item and Edit profile on your card, beside the items you have listed and sold. Seller policies set out your returns, shipping and delivery, and a Status filter narrows your items.","title":"Sell a collectible"},{"line":"The wallet’s history and filters","media":{"id":"nerd-town-job-wallet-first-screen","type":"image","src":"/nerd-town/wall/wallet-first-screen.webp","alt":"The first screen of the Nerd Town wallet: the wallet icon filled in the header, Total, Income and Spending in Bitcoin Cash, Deposit and Withdraw, the Status, Year, Month and Transaction type filters with a search, and the first rows of the history, each with a person, an order, a time, an amount in or out, and its status, a button or a receipt.","caption":"Wallet: the totals, Deposit and Withdraw, the filters and the first rows of the history.","provenance":"production","width":1080,"height":768,"aspectRatio":"1080 / 768"},"text":"Status, Year, Month and Transaction type narrow the wallet’s history, and a search finds a single row. Deposits and withdrawals are rows of that history too, each with its receipt number, among the sales and purchases.","title":"Pay and get paid"}],"label":"Three jobs of the shop"}]}],[]]
